    "description": "Don't miss this rare opportunity to own a classic Edwardian duplex in the highly coveted Russian Hill neighborhood. Built in 1907, this beautifully preserved building exudes original turn-of-the-century charm and incredible potential. The lower unit is vacant and features 967 sf which includes two bedrooms, one bathroom, a cozy living room, a kitchen, and a bonus room perfect for an office. The primary bedroom features a fireplace, and there's potential for a laundry room just off the kitchen. New interior paint, new heating system, refinished hardwood floors, makes this unit move-in ready.\nThe upper unit consists of 1,061sf and offers two bedrooms, one bathroom, a spacious living room, an office, and a kitchen with a large walk-in pantry or storage area, along with potential for a laundry room. Like the lower unit, the primary bedroom in the upper unit also features a charming fireplace, adding warmth and character. This unit is currently owner occupied. The large basement has the potential to add a third unit or create a garage. The exterior of the building was recently painted. Whether you're an investor, an owner-occupant, or someone looking to expand and create additional value, this property offers endless opportunities in one of San Franciscos most desirable neighborhoods."
  },
